{"id":"wx2652708807","title":"祝贺！华农20名学者入选爱思唯尔2022“中国高被引学者”榜单","published_at":"2023-03-30T10:15:36+08:00","published_label":"2023-03-30","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibMT830vA1jScrpzFVy325ibT7wrcm1ZwWZs9pAgotcyaG5iauiaOJnKm1BJmCyGtcQ9v1UFeZnKIukw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"3月28日 全球领先的信息分析公司 爱思唯尔(Elsevier) 重磅发布 2022“中国高被引学者” (Highly Cited Chinese Researchers) 榜单 我校有 20位 学者上榜 比去年增加 6 位 本次榜单共有…","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652708807&idx=1&sn=b52cc3e797768033349ebb7832a9a0e0","paper_url":null,"word_count":705,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T17:00:07+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><span>3月28日</span></section><section><span>全球领先的信息分析公司</span></section><section><span>爱思唯尔(Elsevier) </span></section><section><span>重磅发布</span></section><section><strong><span>2022“中国高被引学者”</span></strong></section><section><strong><span>(Highly Cited\nChinese Researchers)</span></strong></section><section><strong><span>榜单</span></strong></section><section><span>我校有<strong>20位</strong>学者上榜</span></section><p><span>比去年增加<strong>6</strong>位</span></p><section><span>本次榜单共有</span></section><section><span>来自全国504所</span></section><section><span>高校、企业科研机构的</span></section><section><span>5216名学者上榜</span></section><section><span>我校上榜人数位居</span></section><p><span>全国高校<strong>第57名</strong></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibMT830vA1jScrpzFVy325ibjXKfWjXZduPRMiaLCxOiaVT0TuRd7pQBPe1bnn9J0eoJTmWL8AZk2jkg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span>本次榜单覆盖了教育部</span></section><section><span>10个学科领域、84个一级学科</span></section><section><span>我校上榜的</span><strong><span>20位</span></strong><span>学者</span></section><section><span>分布在</span></section><section><strong><span>农学、理学、工学</span></strong><span>学科领域</span></section><section><span>涉及</span></section><section><span><strong><span>兽医学、作物学、园艺学、</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span>农业资源与环境、植物保护、</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span>生物学、农业工程、化学工程与技术、</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span>环境工程与技术</span></strong></span></section><p><span>等9个教育部一级学科</span></p><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8iaMYVaHrleChkibDADhfUOrJCHHCE2ibduwbShiaic1zyaWiaEL7c53ZKeY6hhxGnl59UpU7qU6jyPxVA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></p><section><span><span>2022“中国高被引学者”榜单</span>以全球领先的信息分析公司爱思唯尔(Elsevier)的引文与索引数据库Scopus作为统计来源，采用了上海软科教育信息咨询有限公司开发的方法，从多个维度深度剖析、识别处于科研职业生涯不同时期的中国学者、并系统性展示其科研成果表现。这是自2015年以来双方合作进行的第九次发布，爱思唯尔为该榜单提供了数据支持和技术实现。</span></section><section><span>通过发布“中国高被引学者”榜单，爱思唯尔希望能系统性地展示中国科研领域的人才分布现状，而且精准呈现各机构、高校优势学科构成，以及在关键技术研究和各重点领域的突破创新。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibMT830vA1jScrpzFVy325ibic9FDUrr9CgZI7Ic39vnicfSbtJbiaRt8ia9ehABQiby6aal8EDE53BFFUQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></p><section><strong><span>祝贺所有上榜学者！</span></strong></section><section><strong><span>愿所有华农人<br/></span></strong></section><section><strong><span>再接再厉，</span></strong><strong><span>争创一流！</span></strong></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/w4bIWyNFlc9PWVFvMxhxzwtYVAAQQTo2xrCAJlEYZGlyOOhIV6VSjP6OMKrVI2pvs3dRHm2kI0DMqrUc7UOkgA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></p><section><section><section><p><strong>▶ 往期回顾</strong></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652708792&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=8340216a3710a27ec393d015c672bf79&amp;chksm=bcd61ca78ba195b1085b30a53e1bb17059e6d6cb0834ce66d5eae8ecc004a2057acc4d29249a&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"http